Z||000000||Jefrysuko||05-22-2001||12:56 PM||||I would just like to bring some perspective to the forum.  I have been a member of the Fiero list since 1996.  I have seen the list go through many changes.  When I first joined Peter Zurich monitored the list much like Cliff does here.  He would suspend people who were posting topics that were intended to flame others.  In occasion he would kick off people that didn't obey the rules of the list.  I grew to love being on the list.  I remember the knowledgeable people on the list.  I still remember asking what exactly the difference was in the 88 suspension/frame and getting a 5 page e-mail back from someone who even went and listed part numbers of every item that was different on the 88 suspension including every different option.<P>Since those days Peter is much less attentive.  Someone who is not following the rules is left without reprimand.  A bashing session is left un attended and can go on for several days.  The good knowledgeable people have left, many to this Forum!!!!!  The posts are much less interesting.<P>I just recently started monitoring this forum and was glad to see that it had many of the traits that drew me to the Fiero List many years ago, that is until today.<P>We all know that 84Bill, FieroLisa and gritloch know what they have done to start this recent trend in posts.  They have all done some things that were uncalled for, but they all bring something WONDERFUL to this list.  What I am talking about is a sense of community.  If one of them leaves then soon after another will leave, I will leave and you will also and all will be left is the occasional mundane chatter like on the Fiero List.<P>What can be done about this?  STOP FREAKING KEEPING SUBJECTS GOING THAT ARE ONLY ABOUT BASHING!!!!!!!!!!!<P>Yes you can say I am not practicing what I am preaching.  However I am also going to say that if you reply to this then you just killed my efforts.  The only reply that should be seen to this is a bump to remind us all what can happen if this is left to continue.  I don't want to see Cliff have enough of monitoring this list and leave it to fend for it's own because I am fairly certain what will happen and I am sure you do also.<P>And my words to Cliff:  Kill the posts kill all of them!||||reg||1
